        "/figures/C4-ohm.svg": "e9aba90c0cdb89af126e62d397fb00952c59d5b527d5108c64ae34af5180874b"
      },
      "figureReview": "Complete XML and rendered diagram read: V vertical,I horizontal, straight line throughorigin,DeltaV/DeltaI triangle labelledR. Markedpoints coincide withline within subpixel rendering precision; no numeric axis calibration or pixel-based resistance assigned.",
